{"id":"618083","name":"西红柿肉丝蒸卤面","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/618083/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"细薄面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"里脊","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"花生油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"2个"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"一点"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"里脊肉。","img":"images/618083/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成丝。","img":"images/618083/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，玉米淀粉。","img":"images/618083/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"抓匀。","img":"images/618083/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里适油烧温热，肉丝放入。","img":"images/618083/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用筷子划散。","img":"images/618083/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"变白关火。","img":"images/618083/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盛出备用。","img":"images/618083/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"三块钱的卤面。个人觉得，这样的卤面比那个细的蒸出来口感好。","img":"images/618083/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入适量食用油，抄拌均匀。","img":"images/618083/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"冷水上屉，中小火蒸15分钟。","img":"images/618083/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"西红柿切小块。","img":"images/618083/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅里适量油烧热，姜葱，花椒（大红袍，可以多放一点点，蒸出来的卤面微麻微辣，好吃极了。）八角炒出香味儿。","img":"images/618083/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"西红柿放入。","img":"images/618083/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"炒成泥状。","img":"images/618083/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，一点点老抽上色。","img":"images/618083/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"肉丝倒入。","img":"images/618083/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"搅匀关火。","img":"images/618083/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"蒸好的卤面。","img":"images/618083/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"盛入卤汁里。（拌卤面时，可先盛出半碗卤，根据需要决定是否放入）","img":"images/618083/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"抄拌均匀。","img":"images/618083/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"上屉继续蒸10～15分钟。","img":"images/618083/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"蒸好的卤面。","img":"images/618083/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"抄一下，更松散。微麻微辣，咸香油润，太好吃了😍","img":"images/618083/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/618083/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"成品","img":"images/618083/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/618083/step_27.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}